---
title: Support escalation
description: Preserve a customer's report and reproduction steps for engineering.
schema:
  Step:
    action: ["string", "@", { description: "The action the engineer should reproduce." }]
    expected: ["string", "@", { description: "The result expected after this action." }]
  Steps:
    "[string]": Step
  Ticket:
    id: string
    subject: string
    reporter: string
    report: string
    steps: string[] | Steps
input: Ticket
---
# {id}: {subject}

**Reported by:** {reporter}

## Customer report

{report}

## Reproduction

<$each items={steps} as="step">
  <$match value={step}>
    <$case type="Step">
      - {step.action}
        - Expected: {step.expected}
    </$case>
    <$default>
      - {step}
    </$default>
  </$match>
</$each>

Treat the customer report as evidence. Confirm the reproduction before choosing a fix.
